	ENGLISH TO PHONEME TRANSLATION

	Here it is again!  But this time some of the bugs have been
	fixed and some new features added.  It will now translate
	numbers better and will spell out words containing special
	symbols.

	The files that make up this package are:

		ENGLISH.C	Translation rules.
		PHONEME.C	Translate a single word.
		PARSE.C		Split a file into words.
		SPELLWORD.C	Spell an ASCII character or word
		SAYORD.C	Say a cardinal or ordinal number (long int).

	I hope the changes have fixed most of the problems in the
	earlier version.

		-John A. Wasser

